<title>BRAZIL: Brazil's Cemig 1996 net slightly lower.</title>
<headline>Brazil's Cemig 1996 net slightly lower.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Minas Gerais state power utility Cemig issued the following statement on its 1996 results.</p>
<p>			     1996		  1995</p>
<p>    Net profit	   210 million		217 million</p>
<p>    Operating revs     2.417 bln	    1.956 bln</p>
<p>NOTE: All figures in Brazilian reais.</p>
<p>((-- Fatima Cristina, Sao Paulo Newsroom 5511 2485412))</p>
</text>
